# Code owners for this repository. The last matching line wins.
#
# A line only takes effect when the team has write access to the repository
# and a ruleset on the default branch requires review from code owners.
#
# Supply-chain policy is reviewed by the Security Officers:
# - .gitleaksignore accepts a secret-scan finding as not a secret
# - licence-exemptions.json accepts a package despite its licence
# - the compliance caller decides which gates run and against which version
# - this file decides who reviews everything else
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @SpringTree/security-officers
/.github/workflows/compliance.yml   @SpringTree/security-officers
/.gitleaksignore                    @SpringTree/security-officers
/licence-exemptions.json            @SpringTree/security-officers
